  "config": {
    "file": "Assets/Loadable/UI/UIPanel/ProfileTheme/ProfileThemeConfig.json",
    "howto": "交付包不会改已有的配置文件(避免覆盖别人同时加的条目)。ProfileThemeConfig.json 的结构是 {\"configs\": [...]},把下面的条目加进 configs 数组末尾:",
    "entry": {"themeId": "{id:int}", "pgcId": "{id+150100000}", "themeName": "{f:title}", "previewTitle": "{f:previewTitle}", "title": "{f:title}",
              "colorInfo": {"titleBgColor": "{f:titleBgColor}", "profileCardColor": "{f:profileCardColor}", "mainBgColor": "{f:mainBgColor}",
                            "cardSubColor": "{f:cardSubColor}", "placeHolderColor": "{f:placeHolderColor}", "textColor": "{f:textColor}",
                            "textBorderColor": "{f:textBorderColor}", "gridColor": "{f:gridColor}", "priceColor": "{f:priceColor}",
                            "titleInfoColor": "{f:titleInfoColor}",
                            "info_bg1": "Assets/Loadable/UI/Themes/Theme_{id}/Bg1.prefab", "info_bg2": "Assets/Loadable/UI/Themes/Theme_{id}/Bg2.prefab",
                            "info_bg3": "Assets/Loadable/UI/Themes/Theme_{id}/Bg3.prefab", "info_bg4": "Assets/Loadable/UI/Themes/Theme_{id}/Bg4.prefab",
                            "info_bg5": "Assets/Loadable/UI/Themes/Theme_{id}/Bg5.prefab"},
              "localPath": "Assets/Loadable/UI/Themes/Theme_{id}/ThemeBg{id}/ThemeBg{id}.prefab"}
  },
  "afterImport": [
    "缩略图进 ProfileTheme 图集(Textures 文件夹):Unity 打开后图集会重新打包,.spriteatlas 的变化一起提交。",
    "背景 / 合成效果图 2436 宽,超过 2048 上限,构建时会被缩小(主工程现有皮肤也是这样)。",
    "可选:在 ProfileThemeConfig.cs 的枚举 ProfileTheme 里加一项(只做注释用)。pgcId 按 1501000NN 推的,和服务端 / 策划确认一下。"
